# Keep the language breakdown on what the plugin ships. Excluded here is developer tooling
# only: the CI, release and fixture scripts, the Gradle build definition, and the convenience
# Makefile. The Kotlin under src/ and the Rider C# backend stay counted, since both end up in
# the published ZIP. These files stay first-party, so neither linguist-vendored nor
# linguist-generated would be true of them.
scripts/** linguist-detectable=false
tools/** linguist-detectable=false
Makefile linguist-detectable=false
*.gradle.kts linguist-detectable=false
buildSrc/** linguist-detectable=false
